hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15527","Hashim ibn al-Qasim narrated to us: Abu Muawiyah, meaning Shayban, narrated to us, from Yahya ibn Abi Kathir, from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim, that Ibn Abis al-Juhani said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: O Ibn Abis, shall I not inform you of the best by which those who seek refuge seek refuge? I said: Yes, O Messenger of Allah. He said: Say: I seek refuge in the Lord of al-Falaq, and: Say: I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind."
